{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":21313650,"ns":0,"title":"Exponential field","extract":"In mathematics, an exponential field is a field with a further unary operation that is a homomorphism from the field's additive group to its multiplicative group.  This generalizes the usual idea of exponentiation on the real numbers, where the base is a chosen positive real number.","description":"Mathematical field with an extra operation","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}